        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(cli-runner): replace redundant dynamic import with static import of claude-live-session",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`src/agents/cli-runner.ts` uses a dynamic `await import()` inside the `cleanupCliLiveSessionOnRunEnd` block to load `closeClaudeLiveSessionForContext` from `./cli-runner/claude-live-session.js`, even though the same module is already imported statically at the top of the file for `shouldUseClaudeLiveSession`.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nNode.js module cache ensures a second dynamic import of an already-loaded module returns the exact same module object. Adding `closeClaudeLiveSessionForContext` to the existing static import removes the indirection with no behavioral change.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo user-visible impact.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `npm run typecheck` passes.",
